        {
          "ruleId": "pmat.duplication-hit",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "duplication_hits[] has one semantic entry: dense_prefill_chunk_rows (crates/aprender-serve/src/gguf/cuda/generate_2.rs:1143-1149) closely parallels the pre-existing, unchanged attention_rows_for/chunk_rows_for pair (crates/aprender-serve/src/gguf/cuda/forward_qwen35_cuda_prefill.rs:208-213); both size a chunk to keep an attention-score buffer within PREFILL_SCORES_BUDGET_BYTES. The new helper multiplies by raw num_heads where the existing one uses GQA-grouped heads_per_kv (num_heads/num_kv_heads), which is always <= num_heads -- so the new helper is more conservative (smaller chunks than strictly necessary under GQA), not incorrect. Advisory: whether reuse of the existing helper was considered is worth a one-line author response, not a blocker. Unchanged between 23f058b6ba and this subject (31cd3f6c40 only touches prefill.rs)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "crates/aprender-serve/src/gguf/cuda/generate_2.rs" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1143, "endLine": 1149 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "relatedLocations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "crates/aprender-serve/src/gguf/cuda/forward_qwen35_cuda_prefill.rs" },
                "region": { "startLine": 208, "endLine": 213 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "grounding": "measured",
            "command": ["pmat", "query", "\"chunk rows attention budget\"", "--duplicates", "--limit", "20"],
            "exit_code": 0,
            "failure_scenario": "If the two helpers diverge further under future edits (one updated, one not), the more conservative one silently under-utilizes the score budget rather than overrunning it -- not a correctness bug today, a maintenance/DRY gap."
