            "text": "complexity_delta has one entry: generate_2.rs::run_prefill cognitive complexity 17->18 (base->head), from the new chunking loop. Below the 10-per-fn gate is already exceeded pre-existing (not this diff's doing); the +1 delta is the loop itself and is not flagged as a regression by .pmat-gates.toml's max_complexity=10 rule (that gate is already failing pre-existing debt, unchanged in kind by this diff)."
          },
