          "message": {
            "text": "Queried: IQ4_XS ggml quantization block layout (136 bytes, 256-value superblock, 6-bit per-group scale). Result: no-authority-found -- IQ4_XS is a ggml/llama.cpp-originated format, not documented in NVIDIA's CUDA/PTX corpus, so the docs consultation has no authority over its format-specific claims. Verified instead against the file's own embedded CPU-reference bitwise-parity test (f16_iq4xs_dequant.rs::iq4_xs_dequant_is_bitwise_the_cpu_reader), which is a different grounding (measured-by-test), not this consultation."
          },
